---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="BurnhamEYE™ | Mobile Field Inspections & Compliance App" description="BurnhamEYE™ documents installations for inspection, reporting and archiving with geo-tagged, time-stamped data, secure storage and code-referenced scorecards." nav="technology">
  <div class="page-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>Technology</li><li>BurnhamEYE™</li></ol>
      <nav aria-label="Technology"><a href="/our-technology/permit-mapper/">PermitMapper™</a><a href="/our-technology/burnham-eye/" aria-current="page">BurnhamEYE™</a></nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">BurnhamEYE™</div>
        <h1 class="h-display">Documentation and verification, <span class="hl-block">simplified.</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">BurnhamEYE is a mobile app that gives field teams a consistent, secure way to document installations for inspection, reporting or archiving. Everything collected is stored securely and available anytime in an interactive hub.</p>
        <div class="row">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#download">Download the app</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="https://www.burnhamnationwide.com/hubfs/BurnhamEYE/Burnham_EYE_Blueprint_FINAL.pdf">Read the BurnhamEYE Blueprint</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="media media--tall"><img src="/assets/img/services/burnhameye-field.jpg" alt="A technician recording a solar panel installation on a tablet while a colleague inspects the panel" width="1800" height="1201"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Save time and money</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Field data, verified where and when it was gathered.</h2>
        <p class="body">Field employees compile and update information in real time, with secure storage and access for multiple users. Every entry is geo-tagged and time-stamped.</p>
        <p class="body">Your team or Burnham’s quality control team can then review the data as a third-party inspection. The result is an easy-to-read report and scorecard that references industry codes and standards, on a platform your team shares.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/assets/img/services/burnhameye-scorecard.png" alt="BurnhamEYE scorecard showing photos and scores for AC/DC disconnects and electrical conductors, with NEC references" width="1384" height="1197" loading="lazy" style="border: 1px solid var(--border-default); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--white);">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <img src="/assets/img/services/burnhameye-phones.png" alt="Two phones running BurnhamEYE: a site information form and a map of inspection pins" width="1384" height="1197" loading="lazy">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">What it does</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">BurnhamEYE™ allows you to:</h2>
        <ul class="list">
          <li>Document installations in a standardized, consistent way</li>
          <li>Identify installation deficiencies before systems are interrupted</li>
          <li>Simplify and standardize the audit and documentation process</li>
          <li>Store data securely with easy access for authorized users</li>
          <li>Affordably document 100% of installations</li>
          <li>Collect accurate and complete information</li>
          <li>Collaborate with your team interactively</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="wrap stack stack--lg">
      <div class="stack stack--sm section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Improving the way you do business</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Fewer truck rolls. Better quality. One record.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid--3">
        <div class="stat"><h3 class="h-sm">Reduce soft costs</h3><p class="body" style="margin-top: 8px;">On-site crews gather required information in real time, and post-inspection issues are identified remotely, eliminating unnecessary truck rolls.</p></div>
        <div class="stat"><h3 class="h-sm">Maintain quality control</h3><p class="body" style="margin-top: 8px;">Confirm that crew and contractor work meets required standards.</p></div>
        <div class="stat"><h3 class="h-sm">Consolidate QA reports</h3><p class="body" style="margin-top: 8px;">Build an asset portfolio you can share with finance and investment partners, industry professionals and prospective clients.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Forms</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Designed to collect the data you need.</h2>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div><h3>Pre-installation</h3><p>Document site conditions before installation.</p></div></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div><h3>Installation quality assurance</h3><p>Collect installation data in real time.</p></div></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div><h3>System design verification</h3><p>Verify that installed equipment matches the approved system plan.</p></div></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div><h3>O&amp;M verification</h3><p>Confirm that required corrections and scheduled preventive maintenance are complete.</p></div></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div><h3>Battery system inspection</h3><p>Built specifically for battery storage systems.</p></div></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div><h3>Construction</h3><p>Forms for specific residential and commercial construction applications.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="callout">
          <div class="callout__title">Need a different form?</div>
          <div class="callout__body"><a class="link" href="/contact/">Contact Burnham</a> and we will create one to meet your needs. See how <a class="link" href="/final-review-blog/the-burnhameye-a-key-tool-for-arizona-public-services-rooftop-solar-program/">Arizona Public Service Company uses BurnhamEYE</a> in its Solar Partner Program.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="media media--tall"><img src="/assets/img/services/solar.jpg" alt="An inspector using a tablet beside rows of solar panels, a yellow hard hat resting on a panel" width="1800" height="1202" loading="lazy"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted" id="download">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Get the app</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Download BurnhamEYE™.</h2>
        <p class="body">The app is free to download. Contact our team for pricing information.</p>
        <div class="row">
          <a class="btn btn--dark" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/burnhameye/id1006875367">App Store</a>
          <a class="btn btn--dark" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.burnhameye.android.forms">Google Play</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small">Use of the app is subject to the <a class="link" href="https://www.burnhamnationwide.com/burnhameye-terms-and-conditions">BurnhamEYE™ terms and conditions</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div><h3>Download</h3><p>Get BurnhamEYE from the Apple App Store or Google Play, or search “BurnhamEYE” on your phone.</p></div></li>
        <li class="step"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div><h3>Register your device</h3><p>Open the app and register your device to access the BurnhamEYE forms.</p></div></li>
        <li class="step"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div><h3>Start documenting</h3><p>Choose a form and begin collecting geo-tagged, time-stamped data.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap cta-block">
      <div class="stack stack--sm">
        <h2>Standardize your field documentation.</h2>
        <p>Talk to our team about BurnhamEYE pricing, custom forms and third-party quality control review.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Contact our team</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
